mpetitor (includes 3x3) and an additional $2 for each event other than 3x3. \r\n\r\nLate fee will be charged starting September 1st. Late fee will be $15 for each competitor (includes 3x3) and $4 for each event after that, and you will only be able to register for 3x3, 2x2, skewb, and 4x4.\r\n\r\nSpectators get in free. No walk in competitors.\r\n\r\nRegister on the CubingUSA site.\r\n\r\n**lunch**\r\nPizza will be served for $2 a slice.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you to TheCubicle.us for sponsoring this competition. Consider checking them out next time you want to order a puzzle.\r\n\r\n[Directions](https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/dir\/\/10500+E+State+Rte+350,+Raytown,+MO+64138\/@38.9849374,-94.4588741,17z\/data=!4m13!1m4!3m3!1s0x87c0e161caee72d1:0x83aaab1c75d39d09!2s10500+E+State+Rte+350,+Raytown,+MO+64138!3b1!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x87c0e161caee72d1:0x83aaab1c75d39d09!2m2!1d-94.4566854!2d38.9849374) on google maps.","externalWebsite":null}]}